# Adversarial log: www test audit pilot, Phase 3, bounded round

Audited head: 941278cf3. Probe commit: 8f7d94961.

The blog merge holds on three rules. A th post with a trailing '---'
failed and was named. An uppercase th slug failed and was named. A th
post dated before its en twin failed and was named. Empty discovery
fails loudly; no rule swallows posts.

One real false pass: the merged loader never reads a non-.md file. A
temporary .mdx post left all 17 cases green, and the .md-extension rule
can never fail. ADV-8 routes to Green; the committed failing test
src/__tests__/blog-posts-loader.adversarial.test.ts pins the defect and
self-cleans.

The R2 rewrites hold. Three temporary production mutations (flex-wrap
removed, min-w-0 removed, default gradient changed) each failed exactly
the rewritten case. All production files were restored.

